<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 150 bln lire three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 150 bln lire three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credito Italiano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN-UND WECHSEL BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN ITL   COUPON   **6.875     MATURITY    03.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (M) 5-50</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **THERE IS AN OPTION EVERY PAYMENT DATE TO CONVERT TO</p>
<p>		AN FRN PAYING 6M LIBOR PLUS 15 BP.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
